  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project for Promoting Resilient Agricultural Management for Displaced Persons from Nagorno&#x2013;Karabakh and Host Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a UNDP-led initiative aimed at fostering sustainable agricultural livelihoods and economic resilience for refugees displaced from Nagorno-Karabakh and the most affected host communities in Armenia&#x2019;s peri-urban regions. Developed in response to urgent employment, market access, and infrastructure challenges, the project bridges humanitarian relief and long-term development by enabling inclusive, market-driven opportunities in the agricultural sector.</narrative>
  </description>
